{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_10_end",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_10",
  "title": "1:11A.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-10",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_10_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "062010cde48df4bf0957d734f66ff4e60a5491750afac85c761c52c2b1ea965d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们......就这么看着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就这么看着。虽然不知道是怎么回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但反正没有殃及无辜对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么多美食和饮料，就这么浪费了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么浪费看的我都心疼。但我总觉得，这场斗殴好像也是派对的一部分？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安排好的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不太像，啊，有人冲过来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......！怎么......好像......打错人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呆在这儿是不是有点不太安全？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正回事务所也不知道该干嘛，都快通宵了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是明天还要考试？下午？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......糟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那边两位，似乎不是这场闹剧的相关人员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "应该建议他们远离这里，不小心会受伤的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......慢着，那个肚子上被开了个洞的人，是企鹅物流的大帝吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他死了喔，你们就不慌张吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慌张？怎么会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大帝先生每个月都会有那么几次玩火自焚。我们习以为常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕他死了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......莫斯提马也许真的不该和你们走得太近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在担心她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是来确保她没有做出什么出格的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，嗯，真是拙劣的演技，既然她那么有闲情逸致，那看来应该没什么值得注意的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先走一步。还有，不要告诉她我来过这里，等完事了我会去找她的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......走掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "突然出现，突然质问，又突然离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特兰现在已经变成这个风格了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呵，我突然开始有些羡慕你这样的年轻人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们总是喜欢自顾自地选择自己的道路，全然不顾自己在时局中的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也是有在好好工作的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是从来没有人能够查清你的根底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你真的查到了什么，那才是最麻烦的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说得对，有些事情的确不该过度深究，特别是和信使莫斯提马扯上关系的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这算什么？职业歧视吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是经验谈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，先暂停一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "法术被压制了.....？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搞什么，原来一直在手下留情的人其实是你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "彼此彼此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但至少，你拖延了足够的时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这臭小子，怎么这么耐打......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼啊，呼啊，论耐力，我，可不会，输给任何人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，做得不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真亏你们能这么快解决那么多的敌人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，这次不会再让你一个人突然消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且这家伙就是幕后黑手吧？当然要亲手暴揍他一顿啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天的运动量真是超乎想象，唔，账单长度也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "德克萨斯姐，我感觉今晚有很多东西没法报销啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要问我，问老板去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是老板他死了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那就一会再说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "话说，没有人去照顾一下老板的尸体吗？就那么躺在地上被踩来踩去的，是不是有点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来，人都到齐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......年轻人总会做出自己的选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使会在风雨飘摇的大地上粉身碎骨，你们也总是如此执意行事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他在说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爷子的碎碎念，忘了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就当是这样吧，安魂夜还开心吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还好啦，就和宿醉一样，绝对不能去想第二天该怎么办。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以没有人去照顾一下老板吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......企鹅物流，还真是让人捉摸不透。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事到如今也没必要在意这点了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "企鹅物流就是企鹅物流，开战的理由也只是老板被人质疑了品味，就这么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？这样的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了捍卫自己的美学付出生命也在所不惜，这才是大帝嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少在让人意外这方面，你们倒是从未让我感到过意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔哦！哪来的沙子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他还有余力吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没错，都认真一点，这和那些打打闹闹可不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一瞬间都不要松懈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "会死的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安魂夜怎么能不热闹一点？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我亲眼见识见识，大帝究竟饲养着一群怎样的怪胎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剑碰到沙子就断开了......真麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，这么多年了，胆敢直接近身对我舞刀弄枪的人可不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么尝尝这个！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，果然没用！可颂，交给你啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我的锤子已经被流沙缠住了喔！动都动不了喔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无用功。只是这样吗，企鹅物流？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不只是这样喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沙盾被打破了，趁现在，能天使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "弹幕射击时间到——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......复数的守护铳？真是麻烦的天使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别想得逞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？竟然挡住了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢啦，拜松！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有我！别怪我对老年人下手太重！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊！还是没打中！！德克萨斯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "休想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交给我，德克萨斯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，利用声音的源石技艺，有趣的小姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还有空，东张西望吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那种角度，竟然被避开了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但至少让他挪了一步，一直站着不动对付我们，总觉得被小看了似的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯，企鹅物流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那件大衣，是我的女儿送给我的礼物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么多年，你是第一个能碰到它的外人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龙门有多少像你们这样的年轻人呢，你们究竟又能担任什么样的位置呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做自己就好了吧，还是说，你生气了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，只是有些五味杂陈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是夜晚的时间所剩无几，是时候——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他、他被击中了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是那个狙击手，从刚才起，一直在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......目标沉默，前去确认。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你为什么——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......少爷，他很危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您不应该这么接近他，他有驱动源石技艺的倾向，这个距离，我没法保证您的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少爷的安全是第一优先，请您理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......难道说，我只是个诱饵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "父亲知道这些事情，所以他才派你来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少爷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少爷......有些事和您想的不太一样，到时候你就会明白了。我向您保证，老爷没有任何利用您的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，企鹅物流也会需要一个解释。但现在，我必须确认鼠王的生死，我得带走他的遗体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没关系，老板不在，现在也没人听你解释。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感谢理解。那么，少爷，请保重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——拜松，现在不是深究这件事的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鼠王还给我们留下了一份大礼，不要忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说不定是炸弹喔，毕竟那个叙拉古人最喜欢炸弹了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是不是不太妙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且敌人也没有完全溃散，他们像是在等着我们一样，怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鼠王就这么被带走了，他们竟然一点反应都没有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": ".....是啊，他们竟然一点反应都没有，唔......应该是这么回事吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "分头行动。空，可颂，能天使，我们压制住剩下的敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拜松和莫斯提马，解决那份礼物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就快日出了，我们的时间不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该死，到底会在哪儿——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很慌张，不要总是这么急躁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是突然发现原来我一直被蒙在鼓里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......莫斯提马小姐，我们之前，是不是和鼠王照过面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你从一开始就猜到了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊哈哈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请不要蒙混过关！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，我也猜不透他到底在想什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是时间的确不多了，近卫局会坐不住的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这附近已经一团乱麻了，算上凑热闹的，根本没法好好侦查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......维多利亚软糖，糖果盒，也许是个线索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过按照常理来考虑，重复使用同一种陷阱是非常愚蠢的行为。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然如此，为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果鼠王真的料到了今晚发生的一切，我们早些时候遇到他就必定不是偶然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从一开始，他就在和我们对话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是他的陷阱，为什么还要给我们提示？这说不通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不知道，也许我们不该这么武断地与他为敌......但是，我有这种直觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不光是猜想，是见到鼠王之后，他始终在尝试暗示某种东西......之类的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......听上去比毫无头绪要好得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": ".....这个就是——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长宽约八十厘米，高四十厘米，放在一个铁盒里——嗯，这算是个大号惊奇礼盒吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能、能拆解吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我一点都不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么赶紧联系德克萨斯他们，也许他们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "似乎来不及了。这大概是定时型的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是炸弹！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是，有点老套。我是说它的造型。当然，这件事本身也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧......莫斯提马小姐，你先走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你打算怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赌一把。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这面盾牌是特制的，我的身体也还算结实，就算押错注，说不定还有活下来的可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当真？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就让我见证到最后吧。不用担心，也许我也可以缩减爆炸的损失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟这是工作嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道了，呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——动手吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你决定了？可那根和我头发的颜色好像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔！莫、莫斯提马！不要突然开玩笑！我差点就——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "计数归零！快躲在我身后！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么不烫——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是什么，糖果！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦，注意落地姿势，不然会摔伤喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "ac5_7_back"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是什么声音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不清楚，但——哇！有人从天上飞过来了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "疼疼疼，今天怎么总是......啊！抱、抱歉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还好啦，你们在玩什么，空中飞人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "疼！什么东西砸着我了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......糖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天上，在掉糖果？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，空气里的甜腻味更重了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们，差不多该收手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？嗯？德克萨斯，你是不是知道些什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道。但是能猜出个大概来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶！！你有什么线索就早点说啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安魂夜，早就过了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王的部下",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......喝早茶吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个点？那不如去天台看日出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王的部下",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们这些黑手党真有意思，总喜欢去天台看日出......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，这糖果砸得我脑壳叮当响——这是停手的信号，都住手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说是住手，可根本就是我们被单方面殴打。疼，浑身疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们，真的停下了，怎么回事，总觉得哪里不太对......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么突然就安静下来了？大家就这么喜欢糖果吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......糖果雨停了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，很短暂吧。如果天上真的能掉下糖果就好了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "似乎是有糖果这么一回事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，不对，那炸弹呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说这个？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃？你把它整个拆下来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让一让。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫斯提马小姐！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，稍微有点没控制好，但愿没烧焦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就只是个普通铁盒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......里面还有一把糖果，呃，全都融化了，黏黏的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个便签是？讯息？鼠王留下的......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "写着什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“安魂夜快乐”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "............哈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
